    <Comments>
        <Comment>
            <Identifier>(0x00002ca7, 0x00004cd8)</Identifier>
            <Text>&lt;b&gt;Tuto 4: square the EEG channels&lt;/b&gt;

Four sine waves are named Fz, Cz, EOG and BIP1.
The Matlab box squares the EEG channels, Fz and Cz,
and passes EOG and BIP1 on unchanged.

A channel's type is taken from its name, as the
Signal display does: see tuto4_square_eeg_Process.m.

Leave "Matlab executable (path)" empty to use the newest
MATLAB installed, or set it to your MATLAB's matlab.exe.</Text>
